@startuml seq_dia_sessions
title SC-DIA-01 - Diagnostic sessions, tester present and S3 timeout (application)

participant "UDS tester" as Tester
participant "Plant model" as Plant
participant "TCU" as TCU

note over Tester, TCU
Covers: SYS-DIA-001, SYS-DIA-002, SYS-DIA-003, SYS-COM-005, SYS-FLT-007, SIM-TST-003, SIM-TST-004
UDS over ISO-TP: requests on DIAG_PhysReq 0x7E1, responses on DIAG_Resp 0x7E9, 3E 80 on DIAG_FuncReq 0x7DF;
padding 0xCC, flow control BS = 0, STmin = 0 ms, N_Bs / N_Cr 1000 ms (can_matrix section 5).
CAN frames pass can0 / slcand / gateway transparently (DC-05, SIM-GW-001), see SC-STA-04.
end note

note over TCU: control active, default session after reset
Tester -> TCU : 22 F1 86
TCU --> Tester : 62 F1 86 01
note right: default session

== extended session ==
Tester -> TCU : 10 03
TCU --> Tester : 50 03 00 32 01 F4
note right: P2 = 50 ms (00 32), P2* = 5000 ms in 10 ms units (01 F4)\n(reprogramming section 12)
Tester -> TCU : 22 F1 86
TCU --> Tester : 62 F1 86 03

Tester -> TCU : 3E 00
TCU --> Tester : 7E 00
loop every 2 s while the tester keeps the session
  Tester -> TCU : 3E 80 (functional 0x7DF, no response)
  TCU -> TCU : S3 timer restarted
end

== return to the default session ==
Tester -> TCU : 10 01
TCU --> Tester : 50 01 00 32 01 F4
Tester -> TCU : 22 F1 86
TCU --> Tester : 62 F1 86 01

== S3 timeout with 28 and 85 active ==
Tester -> TCU : 10 03
TCU --> Tester : 50 03 00 32 01 F4
Tester -> TCU : 85 02
TCU --> Tester : C5 02
note right: DTC setting off (SYS-FLT-007)
Tester -> TCU : 28 01 01
TCU --> Tester : 68 01
note right: TCU_Actuators / TCU_Status stopped (SYS-COM-005, SC-COM-03)
Plant -> Plant : hydraulic default after 50 ms (SIM-PLT-004)
... no request for S3 = 5000 ms (tester stopped) ...
TCU -> TCU : back to the default session; 28 and 85 undone (SYS-DIA-003)
TCU -> Plant : TCU_Actuators every 10 ms, TCU_Status every 100 ms
TCU -> TCU : DTC status bits updated again
Tester -> TCU : 22 F1 86
TCU --> Tester : 62 F1 86 01

note over Tester, TCU
14, 19 01 / 19 02, 22, 3E, 10 and 11 01 are available in the default and extended sessions;
27 01 / 02, 28, 31 01 02 03 and 85 only in the extended session (reprogramming section 3).
Every return to the default session, by 10 01 or by the S3 timeout, undoes 28 and 85 (SYS-DIA-003).
end note
@enduml
